{"title": "[Brand] 1.7L Electric Kettle, 304 Stainless Steel, Auto Shut-Off, 1500W", "bullets": ["304 STAINLESS STEEL INTERIOR: The inner pot is made of 304 stainless steel, so water heats in a sturdy, easy-to-rinse metal interior. The lid and handle are PP plastic for a lightweight, comfortable grip.", "AUTO SHUT-OFF & BOIL-DRY PROTECTION: The kettle switches off automatically once the water boils. If it is turned on with too little or no water, boil-dry protection cuts the power.", "360° SWIVEL BASE: Lift the kettle off the base and set it back from any angle. This works the same for right- and left-handed users and makes it easy to grab from any side of the counter.", "CONCEALED HEATING ELEMENT, EASY TO CLEAN: The heating element sits hidden beneath a flat stainless steel floor. There is no exposed coil to scrub around, so you can simply wipe and rinse the interior.", "1.7L CAPACITY, 1500W POWER: Holds up to 1.7 liters, enough for several mugs of tea, coffee, oatmeal, or instant noodles in one batch. It runs on standard US 120V/60Hz outlets at 1500W. In our in-house testing, a full 1.7L boiled in about 5 minutes. This is not a third-party test result, and actual time varies with water temperature and volume."], "description": "Hot water for tea, pour-over coffee, oatmeal, or instant soup is ready with the press of a switch. This 1.7L electric kettle has a 304 stainless steel inner pot and runs at 1500W on standard 120V US outlets, so it fits easily into your morning routine.

The kettle turns itself off when the water boils, and boil-dry protection shuts off power if it is switched on without enough water. The 360° swivel base lets you lift the kettle off and set it back down from any direction. The heating element is concealed under a flat stainless steel floor, so cleanup is just a quick wipe and rinse.

The lightweight PP plastic lid and handle make pouring easy, and the 1.7L capacity lets you fill several mugs at once. In our in-house testing (not a third-party report), a full kettle boiled in about 5 minutes. Actual boil time depends on starting water temperature and fill level.", "search_terms": "electric tea kettle hot water boiler cordless teapot pour over coffee 1.7 liter large capacity fast boiling water heater kitchen appliance office dorm swivel base boil dry protection concealed heating element", "notes_zh": "标题按 AMZ-01 控制在 75 字符以内（共 71 字符），无促销词或特殊符号。没有 UL/ETL/NOM/FDA 认证、未做 BPA/LFGB 检测，所以不写 BPA-free、food-grade certified 或任何认证宣称。5 分钟烧开明确标注为工厂内部测试、非第三方报告。不写 eco-friendly、Made in USA、价格或库存。Prop 65 是否需要警示须由供应商检测资料确认后再决定是否加警示。"}
